Here's a simple level I made, as a demonstration of the level compiler.
I didn't put a way into or out of it (got there with ^V in wiz mode),
and there's nowhere else you can go on the level, but it contains the
largest possible size for a store, I think -- 1,386 items.
I'm off on the right edge, and Adelie is visible near the middle.


"Hello, wizard!  Welcome to Possogroenoe's general store!"

